# Route @kameas-ai-scoped packages to GitHub Packages.
# This eliminates git-URL resolution for @kameas-ai/kenaz-design-system — no git
# clone occurs during install, so local git insteadOf rewrites (ssh) cannot
# affect the lockfile.
#
# NODE_AUTH_TOKEN must be set in the environment for npm ci / npm install.
# In GitHub Actions this is the GITHUB_TOKEN secret; locally it is a classic
# PAT with packages:read scope for the kameas-ai org.
#
# See kenaz/frontend/PACKAGES_AUTH.md (sibling product, same pattern) for how
# to mint a PAT and configure this locally.
@kameas-ai:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
